{
  "summary": "This experiment tested multiprofile settings with pca_n2000 RNA encoder and avgpool aggregation, isolating the effect of profile configuration. Validation accuracy of 0.591 (F1: 0.573) exceeds the singleprofile baseline with pca_n2000 (0.485), suggesting multiprofile may improve performance for lower-performing encoders. However, the role of aggregation methods and interactions with other design choices remains uncertain, as comparisons to scvi_n200 in multiprofile settings are not yet available."
}

